      ζ : Subtype fun x => Membership.mem (rootsOfUnity (Fintype.card (Units M)) R) x
      ⊢ Eq ↑↑((fun χ => ⟨χ.toUnitHom (Classical.choose ⋯), ⋯⟩) ((fun ζ => MulChar.of …
    -/
